  "privacyPolicyBody": "Kabob is a personal budgeting app that works entirely on your device.\n\nWhat we collect\nNothing. Kabob has no account, no sign-in, no analytics, no advertising and no tracking. We do not collect, transmit, sell or share any personal or financial information.\n\nWhere your data is stored\nThe budgets, records, categories and wallets you enter are saved only in a private database on this device. They are never uploaded to a server.\n\nBanks and payments\nKabob does not connect to banks, e-wallets or payment services and cannot move money. All balances are typed in by you.\n\nBackups\nYour phone's operating system may include app data in your own device backups (for example Google or iCloud backup), depending on your device settings.\n\nDeleting your data\nUse Settings → Erase all data, or uninstall the app.\n\nChildren\nKabob is not directed at children under 13.\n\nChanges\nIf this policy changes, the updated version will be shown here.\n\nContact\nUse the developer contact listed on Kabob's store page."
